SUMMARY:Live Music & Food Truck
DESCRIPTION:🍷🎶 Live Music & Food Truck Night at Great Bear Vineyards 🎶🥙\nFriday\, April 24 | 5–8pm\nTicket Includes: Glass of Wine & Live Music\nKick back and start your weekend the Great Bear way—with a glass of wine in hand and vineyard views all around. ✨\nWe’ve got another beautiful Friday evening lined up featuring live music from the Wealth of Nations Duo\, bringing their signature laid-back\, feel-good sound to the vineyard. From Grateful Dead favorites to classic rock\, R&B\, and original songs\, their set is the perfect soundtrack for a relaxing night under the open sky. 🎸\n🥙 Come hungry! GyroStop will be onsite serving up fresh\, flavorful Mediterranean favorites—think gyro sandwiches\, falafel\, hummus\, and more—all crafted by Chef Ty and perfect for pairing with your favorite estate-grown wines.\nSip\, relax\, and settle in for an easygoing evening of great music\, delicious food\, and even better company.\n✨ The perfect way to unwind and welcome the weekend—we can’t wait to see you there!
URL:https://thedirt.online/event/live-music-food-truck-3/
LOCATION:Great Bear Vineyards (Great Bear)\, 24800 County Rd 101A
CATEGORIES:Food & Drink,Music
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://thedirt.online/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/4-24-26-Thumbnail.png
ORGANIZER;CN="Great Bear Vineyards":MAILTO:greatbearvineyards@gmail.com
GEO:38.5818013;-121.7499687
