SUMMARY:Tom & the Broken Hearts Live
DESCRIPTION:Tom & The Broken Hearts is Sacramento’s premier tribute to the timeless music of Tom Petty\, delivering the heart\, grit\, and melodic punch that made Petty one of America’s most beloved songwriters. This is not a costume act-it’s a musical celebration built on authenticity\, musicianship\, and a deep love for the songs that shaped generations. The band brings the energy of a rock show\, the warmth of a hometown band\, and the emotional resonance of Petty’s catalog to every stage. \nFaithful\, high energy performances of Tom Petty’s greatest hits\nDeep cuts for true fans\nTight harmonies\, jangling guitars\, and a rhythm section built for big rooms\nA show that connects across ages and musical tastes \nPerfect for festivals\, theaters\, breweries\, casinos\, community concerts\, and any venue that wants a crowd pleasing\, sing along ready night of American rock & roll. \nPresented by Left of the Dial and KDRT \n 
URL:https://thedirt.online/event/tom-the-broken-hearts-live/
LOCATION:Melon Ball – Watermelon Music\, 1970 Lake Blvd\, Suite #1\, Davis\, California\, 95616\, United States
CATEGORIES:Music
